ration.\n\nDeveloped to reduce the challenges of ventilator training and enhance intuitive learning in medical education, VS-Management provides a structured approach to ventilator operation and alarm response management. Through guided simulations, students can systematically acquire essential ventilator skills, improving their competency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bjz2qwRd028Q7kNvwEIW68w&_nc_oc=AdqyrrNtTdxDCcvJQevC-OuG0ebgzmHJA0UhbUGD7mWL1sqYiaZurjB1Z8glnWkmA0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTpobKkY1zcGqFxMP_iwY3m0Z38ga8tW-gayjhMwYztWw&oe=6AFB3DF9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=crty7i6feo4Q7kNvwHio58m&_nc_oc=AdramdGiDaCz8lr6Cl4WsnL4T9kj4yM7BDB_OM8WA9zsdGi-1mrmBEzA4cvv1rFxWmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQuuvC9d41jeyaNOq_onFTg3sAMEdKHcWEA868QtcxnwQ&oe=6AFB2C4F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scont